  {
   "comment": "_Disclosure: I work at viaSocket._\n\nThe maintainer is already building this feature, but if you want to expand beyond the notification providers being implemented, viaSocket Embed could add 2,300+ app integrations (Gmail, Slack, webhooks, Discord, Pushover, SMTP services, etc.) directly in PeaNUT's UI.\n\nUsers would connect their accounts and build notification automations without leaving PeaNUT. For example: \"when UPS status changes to on-battery, send Slack message and create PagerDuty incident.\"\n\nThe integration would be optional (off by default, enabled via env vars). We'd contribute a PR with one backend route to sign auth tokens, one UI entry point for users to access the integrations, and documentation.\n\nWould the maintainers accept an optional PR for this?",
   "comment_url": null,
   "dry_run": true,
   "issue_number": 136,
   "issue_url": "https://github.com/Brandawg93/PeaNUT/issues/136",
